<title>NETHERLANDS: Philips to sell 50 pct stake in UPC.</title>
<headline>Philips to sell 50 pct stake in UPC.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV said it planned to sell its 50 pct stake in United and Philips Communications BV (UPC) to United International Holdings Inc. of Denver, Colorado.</p>
<p>Philips said the sale would raise gross proceeds of approximately 800 million guilders for Philips.</p>
